─────────────────────────────\n[L739] 1. PURPOSE\n[L740] ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n[L742] This handoff defines the current conceptual state for turning myDon / the Don\n[L743] Orchestration surface into a multimodal orchestration instrument.\n\n[L745] The original idea came from DJ/mixer ergonomics.\n\n[L747] The goal is NOT to build a DJ workstation.\n\n[L749] The goal is to reuse proven interaction primitives:\n\n[L751] - faders;\n[L752] - rotary controls;\n[L753] - cue buttons;\n[L754] - mute;\n[L755] - channel selection;\n[L756] - crossfade;\n[L757] - physical muscle memory;\n[L758] - gestures;\n[L759] - hand movement;\n[L760] - rings/gloves;\n[L761] - MIDI;\n[L762] - OSC;\n[L763] - camera hand tracking.\n\n[L765] The eventual experience should allow Don to orchestrate GCE without constantly\n[L766] returning to mouse/keyboard/window-management actions.\n\n[L768] ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n[L769] 2. CURRENT SYSTEM CONTEXT\n[L770] ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n[L772] Main DevPad:\n\n[L774] Coda      | Chiave      | Vittorio\n[L775] Nico      | VoiceBridge | Luce\n[L776] Talon     | Keel        | Falcon\n\n[L778] Main DevPad = stable/project work.\n\n[L780] Rookie DevPad = ad hoc/experimental work.\n\n[L782] myDon = orchestration surface over both.\n\n[L784] Cable Car = bridge/transport path.\n\n[L786] Pigeon = courier/confirmation behavior.\n\n[L788] The physical-control layer sits ABOVE hardware specifics and BELOW orchestration\n[L789] intent.\n\n[L791] ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n[L792] 3. CORE CONTROL DOCTRINE\n[L793] ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n[L795] Binding design principles:\n\n[L797] GESTURE != DEVICE\n[L798] DEVICE != COMMAND\n[L799] COMMAND != AUTHORITY\n\n[L801] INPUT != INTENT\n[L802] INT