l `_shared` → myDon → Luce → return → Drive → Coda, with restart/idempotency verification and **zero manual prompt/result copying by Don**. fileciteturn0file0L597-L631\n\n**Current gate:** **Google Drive read-only recon → Cable Car specification.** The handoff explicitly calls for recon of the Drive estate and loose GCE artifacts **before any cleanup**, followed by the isolated Cable Car root, exact transport contract, capability verification, and only then implementation. fileciteturn0file0L678-L693\n\n**Coda confidence: 98% — PROCEED.**", "text_chars": 1753, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "9a1b57c8-5080-4370-8dc8-de2cc1bd0086", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790261038.152, "updated_at": 1790261118.515135, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Okay, the point of this conversation is to start cleaning up Google Drive. Do a recon pass and give Don an audit of what's in the Google Drive that is not GCE related. ", "text_chars": 168, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "6e98c20b-24f1-4f5d-8e2c-f978d45fd245", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790261047.081206, "updated_at": 1790261048.543268, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "I’ll keep this **read-only**: inventory the Drive root and major loose folders/files, separate clearly non-GCE material from GCE/cable-car candidates, and flag clutter/duplicates or obvious archive candidates without moving or deleting anything.", "text_chars": 245, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citati