ouncil` wrapper was preserved as:\n  **`SUPERSEDED_01_Executive_Council_WRAPPER`**\n  under migration records.\n\n### `00_START_HERE` is live too\n\nI created and populated:\n\n- `README_CURRENT_GCE.md`\n- `CURRENT_AUTHORITY_POINTERS.md`\n- `CURRENT_PROJECT_INDEX.md`\n\nThose now explain the authority surfaces, routing doctrine, project ownership, and the standard project spine.\n\n### Final verification\n\nThe live top-level `GCE` folder returned exactly these seven branches:\n\n```text\n00_START_HERE\n01_GCE_ORG\n02_GCE_IDENTITY\n03_PROJECTS\n04_GCE_DON\n05_REGISTRIES\n06_FROZEN_STATE_AND_ARCHIVE\n```\n\nSo the Drive now speaks the **same authority language as the local estate**, while still being optimized for Drive rather than pretending to be a literal Windows filesystem clone.\n\nAnd most importantly for this project: **Cable Car now has a legitimate project-owned home instead of being designed against a dirty legacy Drive.**", "text_chars": 2307, "code_blocks": 4, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": ["CURRENT_AUTHORITY_POINTERS.md", "CURRENT_PROJECT_INDEX.md", "README_CURRENT_GCE.md"], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "f087457d-5705-44fa-bbab-90e25ddd150b", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790275283.66, "updated_at": 1790275304.124385, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "perfect", "text_chars": 7, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "e6c6c38d-4aae-4ee9-a142-cfb5f40395c8", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790275293.977897, "updated_at": 1790275293.977897, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "model_editable_context", "part_k